{"id":"nce1-073","book":"nce1","numbers":[73,74],"label":"Lesson 73–74","titleEn":"The Way to King Street","titleCn":"到国王街的走法","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/073.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.28,"en":"The way to King Street","cn":"通往国王街的路"},{"t":6.87,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听这段录音，然后再回答这个问题。"},{"t":12.47,"en":"Why did the man need a phrasebook?","cn":"为什么那个人需要一本短语手册呢？"},{"t":18.73,"en":"Last week Mrs. Mills went to London.","cn":"上周，米尔斯夫人去了伦敦。"},{"t":23.59,"en":"She does not know London very well, and she lost her way.","cn":"她对伦敦不太熟悉，结果迷路了。"},{"t":30.47,"en":"Suddenly, she saw a man near a bus stop.","cn":"突然，她在公交车站附近看到一个男人。"},{"t":36.34,"en":"'I can ask him the way,' she said to herself.","cn":"“我可以问他路该怎么走，”她自言自语道。"},{"t":41.82,"en":"'Excuse me,' she said.","cn":"“对不起，”她说。"},{"t":45.24,"en":"'Can you tell me the way to King Street, please?'","cn":"“请问您能告诉我去King Street的路吗？”"},{"t":51.12,"en":"The man smiled pleasantly.","cn":"那个男人愉快地笑了。"},{"t":54.68,"en":"He did not understand English!","cn":"他不懂英语！"},{"t":58.53,"en":"He spoke German.","cn":"他会说德语。"},{"t":61.16,"en":"He was a tourist.","cn":"他是一名游客。"},{"t":64.17,"en":"Then he put his hand into his pocket, and took out a phrasebook.","cn":"然后他把手伸进口袋，拿出一本短语手册。"},{"t":71.87,"en":"He opened the book and found a phrase.","cn":"他打开书，找到了一句话。"},{"t":76.8,"en":"He read the phrase slowly.","cn":"他慢慢地读了这个短语。"},{"t":81.54,"en":"'I am sorry,' he said.","cn":"“我很抱歉，”他说。"},{"t":85.08,"en":"'I do not speak English.'","cn":"“我不会说英语。”"}],"words":[{"word":"week","phonetic":["wi:k"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"周","us":"media/words/nce1/w0555_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0555_e.mp3"},{"word":"London","phonetic":["'lʌndən"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"伦敦","us":"media/words/nce1/w0556_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0556_e.mp3"},{"word":"suddenly","phonetic":["'sʌdnli"],"pos":"ad.","meaning":"突然地","us":"media/words/nce1/w0557_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0557_e.mp3"},{"word":"bus stop","phonetic":["'bʌstɔp"],"pos":"","meani